# Raw run output stays local: per-run test logs (~91 MB) and per-sample latency CSVs (~180 MB).
# The bandwidth and phase-profile CSVs that RESULTS.md and the compare scripts read are committed
# (the repository's root .gitignore excludes *.csv, so they are re-included here).
*.log
!*.csv
results/*_latency.csv
# Raw PC samples (pc_sampler.py, ~10-20 MB per row); the per-section summaries derived from them are committed.
results/*_samples.bin
__pycache__/
# Router ELFs saved by the run scripts (tens of GB): variants/<v>/elf/ and consolidation/builds/ stay local.
variants/*/elf/
consolidation/builds/
